Dataset license
===============

The files under data/raw and the derived files under data/processed originate
from the Medical Abstracts Text Classification Corpus by Schopf, Braun, and
Matthes. They retain the upstream Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0
terms. The full upstream license text is included at
data/raw/UPSTREAM_LICENSE.txt.

Dataset source: https://github.com/sebischair/Medical-Abstracts-TC-Corpus
DOI: https://doi.org/10.1145/3582768.3582795
